---
// ServicePage — the shared money-page layout (/ludhiana/<service>/). Spec: website-plan/blueprints/
// _TEMPLATE-service-page.md (block order SP-0…SP-13 is binding; this file owns it) + the page's own blueprint
// (copy values). Decisions and page-author notes: website-plan/decisions/w1-layout.md §2. Zero client JS.
//
// ── How a page uses it ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// <ServicePage config={…}> plus named slots. `config` holds only what differs per page — its blueprint's copy values,
// verbatim. Everything else comes from the registries, so the page never repeats (or can contradict) them:
//   MONEY_PAGES[path] (services.ts)  hero chips · body CTA label/href/source · 3 areas · OG image · SP-11 card · wa.me prefill
//   faqFor(path) (faq.json)          the SP-10 questions = the FAQPage JSON-LD entries
//   content.ts                       stepsFor(slug), SP6_LINES, R2, R4, r8(), AREA_SLUGS
//   people.ts · reviews.ts           SP-7 cards + block copy · SP-2 reviews/empty state · SP-5 pairs/proof photos
//   routes.ts (isLive) · lastmod.ts  every internal link · the "Last updated" line
// Prices are never typed: the page's frontmatter builds its strings with pricing.ts helpers (fromPrice, priceRange,
// flatPrice, planPrice, addonPrice, …) — `npm run check:prices` fails a typed ₹.
//
// config — ServicePageConfig (exported below):
//   path          MoneyPath — the page's own URL, e.g. '/ludhiana/cat-grooming/' (build error for anything else).
//   title         <title>, blueprint §1 verbatim (₹ via pricing.ts).          description   meta description, §1 verbatim.
//   hero          SP-1 { eyebrow, h1, subhead, subheadShort?, primaryLabel, secondary: 'prices' | 'call',
//                 photo: { name, alt, position? }, notice? }
//                 · primary: label from the blueprint, target fixed by 00 §11 E1/D2 — /book/?src=hero_<slug>; dog-walking
//                   also preselects its plan (/book/?service=dog-walking&src=hero_dog-walking). Renders amber.
//                 · secondary: 'prices' = [See exact prices] → #prices (the SP-4 section) · 'call' = [Call <phone>] → tel:.
//                   Hidden below md (fold law); the sticky bar carries Call + WhatsApp there.
//                 · chips are NOT a config field: MONEY_PAGES[path].heroChips (price chip first, then the trust set).
//                 · notice: the vet emergency line (vet-at-home.md SP-1), rendered under the CTAs after R3, compact
//                   below md — every word stays (W1L-6). Only vet-at-home passes it.
//                 · subheadShort: a phone cut of the subhead; must be a prefix of `subhead` (build error otherwise). The
//                   rest stays in the DOM, hidden below md (W1L-5). Use it only when the cut words repeat the chips.
//   sp3           { heading } — the SP-3 H2 only; the body is the `sp3` slot (band: paper).
//   sp4           { heading, lines?, r2? } — SP-4 H2; the section is id="prices" (band: sand). No `lines` = the
//                 dog-grooming size matrix (PriceMatrix). `lines` = a pricing.ts PriceLineSet name ('cat-grooming',
//                 'dog-walking', 'vet-at-home', 'dog-vaccination') → the flat-price list instead. `r2` replaces R2
//                 (dog-walking: WALK_PAYMENT_LINE). R1 + R2, the mid-page CTA (MONEY_PAGES[path].cta — "Book <Service>
//                 — <price>", source service_<id>) and the /pricing/ link are always rendered.
//   sp5?          { kind: 'pairs' | 'proof', heading? } — SP-5 from reviews.ts, only when real consented photos exist:
//                 'pairs' needs ≥ 2 before/after pairs for the page's services (heading default "Before & after: real
//                 Ludhiana grooms"; breed anchor chips when ≥ 2 breeds); 'proof' needs ≥ 1 proof photo (walking / vet;
//                 heading required). Otherwise the whole block is omitted (template SP-5: never stock, never placeholders).
//   sp6?          { heading? } — default "How it works — booked in under 2 minutes". Steps = stepsFor(slug), the line
//                 under them = SP6_LINES[slug]?.r4 ?? R4, then "See the full process" once /how-it-works/ is live.
//   sp7           { team: 'groomers' | 'walkers' | 'vet', heading?, line?, cardsHeading?, variant? } — heading/line
//                 default to people.ts MEET_GROOMERS / MEET_WALKERS / MEET_VET. Cards only for people already on the
//                 team (honesty law) — so none render until someone is hired; the vet card always renders, [FILL] tokens
//                 included (P046: the launch gate must see the unfilled vet). cardsHeading = an H3 over the cards
//                 (dog-walking "Meet your walkers"); variant 'condensed' (default) | 'full' (vet). "How we hire" → /about/.
//   sp8?          { medical? } — PromiseBand; medical: true appends the registered-vets line (vet / vaccination).
//   sp9           { intro, prefix, heading? } — intro line (blueprint §2/§3 wording), AreaCard anchor prefix ("Dog
//                 grooming at home in"), heading default "Areas we serve in Ludhiana". Cards = MONEY_PAGES[path].areas;
//                 the other 00 §3.3 areas follow as plain text ("…and A, B, C — all of Ludhiana served.").
//   sp10          { heading } — FAQ H2 ("<Service> at home — your questions"). Questions = faqFor(path).
//   sp11?         { siblings?, posts? } — siblings default to the template SP-11 fixed sets (RELATED below); posts =
//                 [{ label, href }] from the blueprint, rendered as text links under the cards only once live.
//   sp12          { heading, support, primaryLabel? } — CtaBand: heading = r8(breed, area?, service?) from content.ts,
//                 support line verbatim; [Book on WhatsApp] → wa.me with the page prefill and [Call <phone>], both
//                 source ctaband_<slug>; R3 under them.
//
// Slots (all optional except sp3):
//   sp3           SP-3 body under its H2: the lead-in, then the ✓-grid — <InfoTable table={PACKAGE_TABLES[slug]} /> on
//                 grooming pages, <CheckList items={…} /> (a ✓-list per package) on the others — then notes / photo.
//                 Paper band: no onTint.
//   sp4-lines     inside the price block, right under R1 + R2 and before the mid-page CTA — e.g. the à-la-carte line.
//   sp4-extra     end of SP-4, after the CTA and the /pricing/ link — H3 sub-sections (breed / season / coat tables,
//                 the vet emergency footer). Sand band: pass onTint to InfoTable / PriceMatrix there.
//   sp5           replaces the data-driven SP-5 body (the section and its H2 stay). Omit it to let config.sp5 decide.
//   sp7-intro     between the SP-7 H2 and its supporting line (cat-grooming's three "why home" points).
//   before-faq    its own band right before SP-10 — only for content a blueprint places there (00 §11: page-specific
//                 sections are H3s inside the nearest block; a new block needs a Decision-log entry).
//
// Minimal page (the cat-grooming shape; every '…' is that blueprint's verbatim text):
//   ---
//   import ServicePage, { type ServicePageConfig } from '../../layouts/ServicePage.astro';
//   import InfoTable from '../../components/InfoTable.astro';
//   import { r8 } from '../../data/content';
//   import { PACKAGE_TABLES } from '../../data/services';
//   import { fromPrice } from '../../lib/pricing';
//   const config: ServicePageConfig = {
//     path: '/ludhiana/cat-grooming/',
//     title: `Cat Grooming at Home in Ludhiana – From ${fromPrice('cat-grooming')} | PetDoorStep`,
//     description: '…',
//     hero: { eyebrow: '…', h1: 'Cat Grooming at Home in Ludhiana', subhead: `… from ${fromPrice('cat-grooming')} …`,
//             primaryLabel: 'Book on WhatsApp', secondary: 'call', photo: { name: '….jpg', alt: '…' } },
//     sp3: { heading: '…' }, sp4: { heading: '…', lines: 'cat-grooming' }, sp5: { kind: 'pairs' },
//     sp7: { team: 'groomers' }, sp9: { intro: '…', prefix: 'Cat grooming at home in' }, sp10: { heading: '…' },
//     sp12: { heading: r8('Persian'), support: `Fixed prices from ${fromPrice('cat-grooming')} · …` },
//   };
//   ---
//   <ServicePage config={config}>
//     <Fragment slot="sp3">
//       <p class="measure m-0">…lead-in…</p>
//       <InfoTable table={PACKAGE_TABLES['cat-grooming']} class="mt-4" />
//     </Fragment>
//   </ServicePage>
// Page-specific pieces (a breed table, an à-la-carte line) are small components under
// src/components/pages/<slug>/ passed into the slots — see src/pages/ludhiana/dog-grooming.astro.
//
// Blocks (DOM order, template §1): SP-0 Breadcrumb · SP-1 Hero · SP-2 proof line + reviews (or the E6 empty state)
// + the E4 CTA row (the body CTA with R2 beside it, 06 §9) · SP-3 · SP-4 + mid-page CTA · SP-5 · SP-6 · SP-7 · SP-8 ·
// SP-9 · (before-faq) · SP-10 · SP-11 (+ "Last updated", P143 — only once LASTMOD has the path) · SP-12 CtaBand.
// SP-13 (sticky bar, float) is Base chrome. Bands: hero paper, then sand / paper alternating from SP-2 (SP-3 always
// paper, SP-4 always sand), so two adjacent sections never share a background (08 §1.4 rule 5); padding 48 → 80px at
// lg (08 §3.1); content max 1200px, 16 → 24px gutters.
import Base from './Base.astro';
import AreaCard from '../components/AreaCard.astro';
import BeforeAfter from '../components/BeforeAfter.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro';
import GroomerCard from '../components/GroomerCard.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import PriceMatrix from '../components/PriceMatrix.astro';
import PromiseBand from '../components/PromiseBand.astro';
import ReviewCard from '../components/ReviewCard.astro';
import ServiceCard from '../components/ServiceCard.astro';
import StepsStrip from '../components/StepsStrip.astro';
import Icon from '../components/icons/Icon.astro';
import { AREA_SLUGS, R2, R4, SP6_LINES, stepsFor } from '../data/content';
import { LASTMOD } from '../data/lastmod';
import { groomers, isPlaceholder, MEET_GROOMERS, MEET_VET, MEET_WALKERS, vets, walkers, type Person } from '../data/people';
import {
  pairsFor, pickReviews, PROOF_LINE, proofPhotosFor, reviewsReady, REVIEWS_EMPTY_STATE, type BeforeAfterPair,
} from '../data/reviews';
import { isLive, routeLabel } from '../data/routes';
import { isMoneyPath, MONEY_PAGES, type MoneyPath } from '../data/services';
import { site, telHref, waHref } from '../data/site';
import { bookHref, type MoneyPage, type PriceLineSet } from '../lib/pricing';
import { schemaGraphLd } from '../lib/schema';

export interface ServicePageConfig {
  path: MoneyPath;
  title: string;
  description: string;
  hero: {
    eyebrow: string;
    h1: string;
    subhead: string;
    subheadShort?: string;
    primaryLabel: string;
    secondary: 'prices' | 'call';
    photo: { name: string; alt: string; position?: string };
    notice?: string;
  };
  sp3: { heading: string };
  sp4: { heading: string; lines?: PriceLineSet; r2?: string };
  sp5?: { kind: 'pairs' | 'proof'; heading?: string };
  sp6?: { heading?: string };
  sp7: { team: 'groomers' | 'walkers' | 'vet'; heading?: string; line?: string; cardsHeading?: string; variant?: 'condensed' | 'full' };
  sp8?: { medical?: boolean };
  sp9: { intro: string; prefix: string; heading?: string };
  sp10: { heading: string };
  sp11?: { siblings?: readonly MoneyPath[]; posts?: readonly { label: string; href: string }[] };
  sp12: { heading: string; support: string; primaryLabel?: string };
}
interface Props { config: ServicePageConfig }

const { config: c } = Astro.props;
if (!isMoneyPath(c.path)) throw new Error(`ServicePage: "${c.path}" is not a money page (services.ts MONEY_PATHS)`);
const m = MONEY_PAGES[c.path];
const slug: MoneyPage = m.slug;

// ── SP-0 + head ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Home › Ludhiana › {page name from 01-SITEMAP}. "Ludhiana" stays text until /ludhiana/ is live; its schema item URL
// is live from day one (04 §2.4). Breadcrumb.astro links an item only while isLive(path).
const crumbs = [
  { label: 'Home', path: '/' },
  { label: routeLabel('/ludhiana/'), path: '/ludhiana/' },
  { label: m.label, path: m.path },
];
// One @graph: Service + FAQPage (faqFor(path) — the entries SP-10 renders) + BreadcrumbList (04 §2.9).
const jsonLd = [schemaGraphLd({ type: 'service', service: slug, crumbs }, Astro.site)];

// ── SP-1 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// E1 / D2 (00 §11): every hero primary → /book/?src=hero_<slug>; dog walking also preselects its service (Trial Week).
const heroSrc = `hero_${slug}`;
const primary = {
  label: c.hero.primaryLabel,
  href: bookHref({ service: slug === 'dog-walking' ? m.preselect ?? undefined : undefined, src: heroSrc }),
  source: heroSrc,
};
const secondary = c.hero.secondary === 'prices'
  ? { label: 'See exact prices', href: '#prices', source: heroSrc }
  : { label: `Call ${site.phone}`, href: telHref(), source: heroSrc };

// ── SP-2 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Cards only once ≥ 3 real Google reviews exist (filtered to this page's services, then nearest, then any); before
// that the 06 §9 E6 line, its URL linked to the Google profile. Never Review markup (04 §2.0.4).
const showReviews = reviewsReady();
const reviews = showReviews ? pickReviews({ services: [...m.serviceIds], count: 3 }) : [];
const [emptyBefore, emptyAfter = ''] = REVIEWS_EMPTY_STATE.split(site.gbpLink);
const proofText = PROOF_LINE.replace(/^★\s*/, ''); // the ★ is drawn as an icon (amber, aria-hidden: 08 §1.5)

// ── SP-5 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
const pairs: BeforeAfterPair[] = c.sp5?.kind === 'pairs' ? pairsFor({ services: [...m.serviceIds], count: 4 }) : [];
const proofs = c.sp5?.kind === 'proof' ? proofPhotosFor(m.serviceIds, 4) : [];
const sp5Slot = Astro.slots.has('sp5');
const hasSp5 = sp5Slot || pairs.length >= 2 || proofs.length >= 1;
const sp5Heading = c.sp5?.heading ?? (c.sp5?.kind === 'pairs' || !c.sp5 ? 'Before & after: real Ludhiana grooms' : undefined);
if (hasSp5 && !sp5Heading) throw new Error(`ServicePage ${c.path}: config.sp5.heading is required for a proof-photo row`);
// Breed chips (dog-grooming.md SP-5): one anchor chip per breed that has a pair, when the gallery shows ≥ 2 breeds.
const breedId = (b: string) => `ba-${b.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, '-').replace(/^-|-$/g, '')}`;
const breeds = [...new Set(pairs.map((p) => p.breed))];
const PERMISSION_NOTE = "All photos shared with the pet parent's permission."; // 06 §4.3 gallery footer note

// ── SP-6 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
const sp6Lines = slug === 'dog-walking' || slug === 'vet-at-home' ? SP6_LINES[slug] : undefined;

// ── SP-7 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
const TEAM = {
  groomers: { people: groomers, copy: MEET_GROOMERS },
  walkers: { people: walkers, copy: MEET_WALKERS },
  vet: { people: vets, copy: MEET_VET },
} as const;
const team = TEAM[c.sp7.team];
// Honesty law (people.ts, template SP-7): no card for anyone not yet on the team. The vet is the exception: the page
// may not ship without a named, registered vet (vet-at-home.md §0.3, 02 P046), so the card renders with its [FILL]
// tokens and the launch gate (check:fill) stops the release until they are real.
const people: Person[] = team.people.filter((p) => c.sp7.team === 'vet' || !isPlaceholder(p)).slice(0, 3);

// ── SP-9 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// The other 00 §3.3 areas, as plain text (template SP-9: exactly 3 area links in the body, P076).
const otherAreas = AREA_SLUGS.filter((a) => !m.areas.includes(a)).map((a) => routeLabel(`/ludhiana/areas/${a}/`));

// ── SP-11 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Template SP-11 fixed sibling sets (change only via the Decision log).
const RELATED: Readonly<Record<MoneyPage, readonly MoneyPath[]>> = {
  'dog-grooming': ['/ludhiana/puppy-grooming/', '/ludhiana/tick-flea-treatment/', '/ludhiana/cat-grooming/'],
  'cat-grooming': ['/ludhiana/dog-grooming/', '/ludhiana/tick-flea-treatment/'],
  'dog-walking': ['/ludhiana/dog-grooming/', '/ludhiana/vet-at-home/'],
  'vet-at-home': ['/ludhiana/cat-grooming/', '/ludhiana/dog-vaccination/', '/ludhiana/tick-flea-treatment/', '/ludhiana/dog-walking/'],
  'dog-vaccination': ['/ludhiana/vet-at-home/', '/ludhiana/puppy-grooming/'],
  'tick-flea-treatment': ['/ludhiana/dog-grooming/', '/ludhiana/vet-at-home/'],
  'puppy-grooming': ['/ludhiana/dog-vaccination/', '/ludhiana/dog-grooming/'],
};
const siblings = c.sp11?.siblings ?? RELATED[slug];
const posts = (c.sp11?.posts ?? []).filter((p) => isLive(p.href));

// "Last updated" (02 P143): the page's real last-material-edit date — the same date as its sitemap <lastmod>.
const MONTHS = ['January', 'February', 'March', 'April', 'May', 'June', 'July', 'August', 'September', 'October', 'November', 'December'];
const lastmod = LASTMOD[c.path];
const lastmodText = lastmod && /^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(lastmod)
  ? `${Number(lastmod.slice(8, 10))} ${MONTHS[Number(lastmod.slice(5, 7)) - 1]} ${lastmod.slice(0, 4)}`
  : null;

// ── SP-12 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
const bandSrc = `ctaband_${slug}`;

// ── Bands: sand / paper alternating from SP-2 (hero = paper; CtaBand = brand-dark) ───────────────────────────────
const hasBeforeFaq = Astro.slots.has('before-faq');
const order = ['sp2', 'sp3', 'sp4', hasSp5 && 'sp5', 'sp6', 'sp7', 'sp8', 'sp9', hasBeforeFaq && 'before-faq', 'sp10', 'sp11']
  .filter((k): k is string => !!k);
const band = (key: string) => ['sp-band py-12 lg:py-20', order.indexOf(key) % 2 === 0 ? 'bg-sand' : 'bg-paper'];
const inner = 'mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 lg:px-6';
---
<Base title={c.title} description={c.description} path={c.path} ogImage={m.og.file} ogImageAlt={m.og.alt} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Photo slot="head" preload preset="hero" name={c.hero.photo.name} />

  {/* SP-0 */}
  <Breadcrumb items={crumbs} />

  {/* SP-1 */}
  <Hero
    eyebrow={c.hero.eyebrow}
    h1={c.hero.h1}
    subhead={c.hero.subhead}
    subheadShort={c.hero.subheadShort}
    crumbAbove
    primary={primary}
    secondary={secondary}
    priceChip={m.heroChips.price}
    trustChips={m.heroChips.trust}
    photo={c.hero.photo}
    notice={c.hero.notice}
  />

  {/* SP-2 — social proof + the E4 CTA row (00 §11 E4: the "after reviews" beat of 02 P153) */}
  <div class:list={band('sp2')}>
    <div class={inner}>
      <section>
        <p class="m-0 flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <Icon name="star" size={20} filled class="flex-none text-cta" />
          <a href={site.gbpLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="prose-link">{proofText}</a>
        </p>
        {showReviews ? (
          <ul class="m-0 mt-6 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-6">
            {reviews.map((r) => <li class="min-w-0"><ReviewCard review={r} onSand /></li>)}
          </ul>
        ) : (
          <p class="measure m-0 mt-3 text-slate">
            {emptyBefore}<a href={site.gbpLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="prose-link">{site.gbpLink}</a>{emptyAfter}
          </p>
        )}
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-4">
          <Button href={m.cta.href} source={m.cta.source} full>{m.cta.label}</Button>
          <p class="m-0 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{R2}</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* SP-3 — what's included (tone: paper) */}
  <div class:list={band('sp3')}>
    <div class={inner}>
      <section aria-labelledby="sp3-heading">
        <h2 id="sp3-heading" class="t-h2 m-0">{c.sp3.heading}</h2>
        <div class="mt-4"><slot name="sp3" /></div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* SP-4 — prices + mid-page CTA (tone: sand) */}
  <div class:list={band('sp4')}>
    <div class={inner}>
      <section id="prices" aria-labelledby="sp4-heading">
        <h2 id="sp4-heading" class="t-h2 m-0">{c.sp4.heading}</h2>
        <PriceMatrix matrix={!c.sp4.lines} lines={c.sp4.lines} r2={c.sp4.r2} onTint class="mt-6">
          <slot name="sp4-lines" />
        </PriceMatrix>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <Button href={m.cta.href} source={m.cta.source} full>{m.cta.label}</Button>
        </div>
        {isLive('/pricing/') ? (
          <p class="m-0 mt-4"><a href="/pricing/" class="prose-link">Compare every service on the full price list</a></p>
        ) : null}
        <slot name="sp4-extra" />
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* SP-5 — before/after or proof photos, only when real, consented photos exist */}
  {hasSp5 ? (
    <div class:list={band('sp5')}>
      <div class={inner}>
        <section aria-labelledby="sp5-heading">
          <h2 id="sp5-heading" class="t-h2 m-0">{sp5Heading}</h2>
          {sp5Slot ? (
            <div class="mt-6"><slot name="sp5" /></div>
          ) : pairs.length >= 2 ? (
            <>
              {breeds.length >= 2 ? (
                <ul class="m-0 mt-4 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-2 p-0" aria-label="Jump to a breed">
                  {breeds.map((b) => (
                    <li>
                      <a href={`#${breedId(b)}`} class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-pill border-[1.5px] border-brand bg-paper px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-brand no-underline hover:bg-mint">{b}</a>
                    </li>
                  ))}
                </ul>
              ) : null}
              <ul class="m-0 mt-6 grid list-none gap-6 p-0 md:grid-cols-2">
                {pairs.map((p, i) => (
                  <li id={pairs.findIndex((x) => x.breed === p.breed) === i ? breedId(p.breed) : undefined} class="min-w-0">
                    <BeforeAfter pair={p} />
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
              <p class="m-0 mt-4 text-sm text-slate">{PERMISSION_NOTE}</p>
            </>
          ) : (
            <>
              <ul class="m-0 mt-6 grid list-none grid-cols-1 gap-4 p-0 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
                {proofs.map((ph) => (
                  <li class="min-w-0">
                    <figure class="m-0">
                      <Photo name={ph.photo} alt={ph.alt} preset="card" class="block aspect-[4/3] h-auto w-full rounded-md object-cover" />
                      <figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate">{ph.caption}</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
              <p class="m-0 mt-4 text-sm text-slate">{PERMISSION_NOTE}</p>
            </>
          )}
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  ) : null}

  {/* SP-6 — how it works */}
  <div class:list={band('sp6')}>
    <div class={inner}>
      <StepsStrip
        heading={c.sp6?.heading ?? 'How it works — booked in under 2 minutes'}
        headingId="sp6-heading"
        steps={stepsFor(slug)}
        r4={sp6Lines?.r4 ?? R4}
      >
        {isLive('/how-it-works/') ? <p class="m-0"><a href="/how-it-works/" class="prose-link">See the full process</a></p> : null}
      </StepsStrip>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* SP-7 — your groomer / walker / vet */}
  <div class:list={band('sp7')}>
    <div class={inner}>
      <section aria-labelledby="sp7-heading">
        <h2 id="sp7-heading" class="t-h2 m-0">{c.sp7.heading ?? team.copy.title}</h2>
        {Astro.slots.has('sp7-intro') ? <div class="mt-4"><slot name="sp7-intro" /></div> : null}
        <p class="measure m-0 mt-3">{c.sp7.line ?? team.copy.line}</p>
        {people.length ? (
          <>
            {c.sp7.cardsHeading ? <h3 class="t-h3 m-0 mt-8">{c.sp7.cardsHeading}</h3> : null}
            <ul class="m-0 mt-6 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 md:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-6">
              {people.map((p) => (
                <li class="min-w-0"><GroomerCard person={p} variant={c.sp7.variant ?? 'condensed'} page={slug} headingLevel={c.sp7.cardsHeading ? 4 : 3} /></li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </>
        ) : null}
        {isLive('/about/') ? <p class="m-0 mt-4"><a href="/about/" class="prose-link">How we hire</a></p> : null}
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* SP-8 — the PetDoorStep Promise */}
  <div class:list={band('sp8')}>
    <div class={inner}>
      <PromiseBand medical={c.sp8?.medical ?? false} />
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* SP-9 — areas served */}
  <div class:list={band('sp9')}>
    <div class={inner}>
      <section aria-labelledby="sp9-heading">
        <h2 id="sp9-heading" class="t-h2 m-0">{c.sp9.heading ?? 'Areas we serve in Ludhiana'}</h2>
        <p class="measure m-0 mt-3">{c.sp9.intro}</p>
        <ul class="m-0 mt-6 grid list-none grid-cols-2 gap-4 p-0 md:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-6">
          {m.areas.map((a) => <li class="min-w-0"><AreaCard slug={a} prefix={c.sp9.prefix} /></li>)}
        </ul>
        <p class="measure m-0 mt-6">…and {otherAreas.join(', ')} — {isLive('/ludhiana/') ? <a href="/ludhiana/" class="prose-link">all of Ludhiana</a> : 'all of Ludhiana'} served.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  {hasBeforeFaq ? (
    <div class:list={band('before-faq')}>
      <div class={inner}><slot name="before-faq" /></div>
    </div>
  ) : null}

  {/* SP-10 — FAQ (FAQPage JSON-LD = the same faqFor(path) entries) */}
  <div class:list={band('sp10')}>
    <div class={inner}>
      <Faq page={c.path} heading={c.sp10.heading} />
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* SP-11 — related services (+ supporting blog posts once live) and the "Last updated" line */}
  <div class:list={band('sp11')}>
    <div class={inner}>
      <section aria-labelledby="sp11-heading">
        <h2 id="sp11-heading" class="t-h2 m-0">Pet parents also book</h2>
        <ul class="m-0 mt-6 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-6">
          {siblings.map((p) => (
            <li class="min-w-0"><ServiceCard path={p} blurb={MONEY_PAGES[p].card.blurb} photo={MONEY_PAGES[p].card.photo} onPage={slug} /></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        {posts.length ? (
          <ul class="m-0 mt-6 list-none space-y-2 p-0">
            {posts.map((p) => <li><a href={p.href} class="prose-link">{p.label}</a></li>)}
          </ul>
        ) : null}
      </section>
      {lastmodText ? (
        <p class="m-0 mt-10 text-sm text-slate">Last updated <time datetime={lastmod}>{lastmodText}</time></p>
      ) : null}
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* SP-12 — page-end CTA (wa.me with the page prefill; full-bleed, a direct child of <main>) */}
  <CtaBand
    heading={c.sp12.heading}
    support={c.sp12.support}
    primary={{ label: c.sp12.primaryLabel ?? 'Book on WhatsApp', href: waHref(m.waPrefill), source: bandSrc }}
    secondary={{ label: `Call ${site.phone}`, href: telHref(), source: bandSrc }}
  />
</Base>
